# aiwar.codebook  —  OSINT graph normalized to the CANON codebook model
# mixin family-node inheritance · 4-nibble (u16) identity · label CAM · head-only (no serialization)
#
# A node is its HEAD only:  classid(OSINT=0x0700) | family(mixin ref) | identity(u16) | edge-adapters
# The category is INHERITED by reference (family id), never copied. No properties are serialized.

@meta
  source          aiwar_graph.json + 30 cypher enrichments
  classid         0x0700   OSINT / Palantir-Gotham
  identity_width  16 bit (4 nibbles)
  families        7
  nodes           674   (entities 534 + schema 140)
  edges           356
  json_bytes      174274
  codebook_bytes  ~5340   (head-only; rho = 0.031 of serialized JSON)

@families            # the codebook CLASSES — entities inherit these by REFERENCE (mixin)
  01  CivicSystem
  02  HistoricalSystem
  03  Person
  04  SchemaAxis
  05  SchemaValue
  06  Stakeholder
  07  System

@edge_types
  1  connection
  2  hierarchical
  3  isDeployedBy
  4  isDevelopedBy
  5  people
  6  place

